  Id: Card_Decaying_Rift
  CardName: Decaying Rift
  Description: For every 7 shapes placed on the board, a red neon tile with a "5"
    counter on it appears. Each time the player places a shape, this counter decreases
    by 1. If the counter reaches 0, that tile becomes a dead zone where no shapes
    can be placed for the remainder of the current milestone. If a line clear includes
    this tile before the counter reaches 0, the rift closes and +2 shapes are added
    to the player's shape pool.
